Z||000007||rogergarrison||01-05-2001||04:00 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by RossT:<BR><B>JB, This is a no brainer. I don't see how anyone could place you at fault. You had the right-of-way.   Good luck. and let us know.  From no on I am going to have one of those cheap cameras in the glove box.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>GOOD IDEA to keep a camera. I do in both my cars. I had a friend who went to canada in his motorhome. He barely hit a car there, but he took pics just in case. as it turned out the people with other car had another wreck after that and tried to stick his insurance co for the whole bill. He got a notice from his insurance co that they had a claim for like $10,000. He said no way there was more than a couple hundred dollars damage, so he sent them the pics he took, and they refused to pay the claim because his pic showed just damage to bumper, their pic they sent showed the whole rear end demolished up to the door.<P>||||reg||1
